    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "She's very peculiar."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B",
        "text": "Quite, Sheetmetal. Such a person, I've never before seen."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "Nor I."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "So you know how to speak after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "A wandering singer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "I know not what a wandering singer is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B",
        "text": "Sheetmetal, do not speak to her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "Your face, unfamiliar. Your attire, strange. You are not one from here. What is your business?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I want to ask a question."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "Your clothes, very new."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "Have you seen my fellow person?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "You have much strength. You are able to eat your fill."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "She came here before I did."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "Your case, very heavy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "An instrument is not a light thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "The thing in your grasp, very uncanny."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I assume your harps should come more or less the same."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "(Plucks strings)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "Ears, pained. It is a weapon."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "It is able to not be."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant B",
        "text": "Sheetmetal, this person, uncanny. Do not heed her. To speak, very tiring."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "Bench. Let go of him."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "Bench... Do you mean this child?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I didn't intend anything for him. He took something of mine. Things like that are significant."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "You came to rob something."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "I'm only taking back what's mine. And looking for someone who can understand me when I talk."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Young Inhabitant",
        "text": "*Whimper*..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_187",
            "name2": "avg_npc_178",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "Our child, you may not touch."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Male Inhabitant A",
        "text": "Our things, you may not rob."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_1012_skadiSP_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Skadi",
        "text": "Hm?"
